{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"}],"title":"setTags:","symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setTags:"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSDictionary","text":"NSDictionary"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"tags"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"tags","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dictionary of tag names and values to set for the current device"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Tags are key-value pairs that enable targeted push notifications based on user attributes","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and behavior. Use tags to segment your audience and send personalized messages to specific","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user groups.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Supported Tag Types","anchor":"Supported-Tag-Types"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Type"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"String","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"city\": \"New York\""}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Text values","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integer"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"age\": 25"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Numeric values"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Boolean","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"isPremium\": true"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"True\/false values","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"List"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"interests\": [\"sports\", \"music\"]"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrays of strings","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Date","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"\"lastPurchase\": Date()","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"NSDate objects"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Example","text":"Example","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Update user profile tags after account changes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func updateUserTags(for user: User) {","        var tags: [String: Any] = [","            \"user_id\": user.id,","            \"email_verified\": user.isEmailVerified,","            \"account_type\": user.accountType.rawValue,","            \"signup_date\": user.createdAt,","            \"app_version\": Bundle.main.appVersion","        ]","","        \/\/ Add subscription info if premium","        if let subscription = user.subscription {","            tags[\"subscription_tier\"] = subscription.tier.rawValue","            tags[\"subscription_expiry\"] = subscription.expiryDate","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = true","        } else {","            tags[\"is_premium\"] = false","        }","","        \/\/ Add user preferences","        if !user.interests.isEmpty {","            tags[\"interests\"] = user.interests","        }","","        \/\/ Add location if available","        if let location = user.location {","            tags[\"country\"] = location.country","            tags[\"city\"] = location.city","            tags[\"timezone\"] = location.timezone","        }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags(tags)","        Logger.debug(\"User tags updated: \\(tags.keys.joined(separator: \", \"))\")","    }","","    func trackPurchase(product: Product, amount: Decimal) {","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"last_purchase_date\": Date(),","            \"last_purchase_amount\": NSDecimalNumber(decimal: amount),","            \"last_purchase_category\": product.category,","            \"total_purchases\": incrementTag(\"total_purchases\")","        ])","    }","}"]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"type":"topic","title":"PWConfiguration","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration","url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setTags:":{"title":"setTags:","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setTags:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Sets user tags for device segmentation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setTags:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setTags:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/settags:"}}}